
### Test GET all clients
GET http://localhost:8080/clients
Accept: application/json

### Test POST new client
POST http://localhost:8080/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Client",
  "address": "123 Test Street",
  "city": "Test City",
  "zip_code": "12345",
  "province": "Test Province",
  "country": "Test Country",
  "contact_name": "John Doe",
  "contact_phone": "123-456-7890",
  "contact_email": "johndoe@test.com"
}

### Test GET client by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/clients/1
Accept: application/json

### Test PUT update client by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Client",
  "address": "456 Updated Street",
  "city": "Updated City",
  "zip_code": "67890",
  "province": "Updated Province",
  "country": "Updated Country",
  "contact_name": "Jane Doe",
  "contact_phone": "098-765-4321",
  "contact_email": "janedoe@test.com"
}

